sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: Buka halaman "Riwayat Scan"
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans
  API->>DB: SELECT scans WHERE user_id = ? (urut terbaru)
  DB-->>API: Daftar scan
  API-->>FE: 200 OK [scans]
  FE-->>U: Tampilkan daftar riwayat
  opt Lihat detail satu scan
    U->>FE: Klik salah satu scan
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans/{id}
    API->>DB: Ambil detail scan + langkah/temuan
    DB-->>API: Detail scan
    API-->>FE: 200 OK {detail}
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan detail (status, langkah, temuan)
  end
